2026-07-27T08:06:22.6417389Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T08:06:22.6476280Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:06:22.6477045Z i /tmp/RtmpPhg67u/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:06:22.6477571Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:06:22.6478175Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:06:22.6478997Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:06:22.6479861Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:06:22.6481095Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:06:22.6482326Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:06:22.6719676Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:06:22.6826427Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:06:22.7246531Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:06:22.7393734Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
